# the intro and the title of the 4DBEGA build (the oracle: DOSBox-X as that machine, the workspace's oracle/w_lapse_ega, a shot every 100 frames); the
# C library's random state (DS:88DE) poked to the oracle's at frame 1000: the start-up's draws depend on the video phase;
# the oracle's game starts 62.9 frames (1.05 s at 59.92 Hz) after DOSBox boots
# bootframes 62.9
poke 1000 369E:88DE aa64bdd1
shot 600 b600
shot 1600 b1600
shot 2500 b2500
shot 3300 b3300
end 3310
